{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jg4nYrSqfl1794814642.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港島南岸Blue Coast租務持續活躍，優質兩房戶獲租客垂青。美聯物業港島南岸項目分行助理聯席董事蕭振邦(James Siu)表示，該行剛促成Blue Coast一個兩房連套房間隔單位租務成交，以月租3.4萬元獲承租。<br/>蕭振邦稱，剛成交的Blue Coast單位為2B座低層C室，實用面積約538平方呎，屬兩房連套房間隔，以月租3.4萬元成交，折合實用呎租約63.2元。屋苑樓齡淺，交通方便，加上單位租金合理，間隔實用，故獲租客垂青承接。<br/>資料顯示，業主於2024年4月以約1,207.1萬元購入上述物業，若以目前租金水平計算，租金回報率約3.4厘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.256042+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T22:57:34.668741+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:16.540554+00:00","content_hash":"4661bed7291dfb263c37396d6e98e3931d8edceb2ea5311a95edd28905696097","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.256042+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}